OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FStorm Boelo arriving around
OL,6,Fdawn to bring patchy rain, with some
OL,7,Fheavy bursts, and strengthening winds.
OL,8,FGradually worsening weather through
OL,9,Fthe day, feeling unpleasant in the
OL,10,Fafternoon with more persistent heavy
OL,11,Frain, and gales possible.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA line of heavy showers will
OL,14,Fquickly pass this evening but lighter
OL,15,Frain will persist until around
OL,16,Fmidnight. Very windy through the night
OL,17,Fwith coastal gales for exposed coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
