OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FA windy morning with scattered
OL,6,Fshowers but these will ease to bring a
OL,7,Fbreezy but dry afternoon with sunny
OL,8,Fspells.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FOn
OL,11,FMonday morning, heavy rain will pass
OL,12,Ffollowed by strong winds with coastal
OL,13,Fgales. Brighter on Tuesday, with
OL,14,Fscattered showers and strong winds. On
OL,15,FWednesday, sunny, dry and breezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
